{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-29182","model_call":34,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2965"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q2965"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_1021036579#16_2047906352","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2965","rank":4,"snippet":"actually mean? And when to use them? iPhone Emoji Meanings: What emojis actually mean? And when to use them? ? Slightly Smiling Face Emoji ? Upside-down Smiling Emoji Smiling Face Emoji ? Smiling Emoji with Eyes Opened ? Smiling Emoji with Smiling Eyes ? Smiling Face with Tightly Closed Eyes ? Smiling with Sweat Emoji ? Tears of Joy Emoji ? Smirk Face Emoji ? Unamused Face Emoji ? Sad Face Emoji ? Relieved Emoji ? Money Face Emoji \" , \"segment\": \"Money Face Emoji The money face emoji sends out a strong message. It signifies spending power. Use this emoji when you’re in the <cover>mood to do some shopping or spending. </cover>It could be an adventure, a pleasure trip, or something that requires spending money. This emoji will attract some attention so be ready whenever you use it. Jessica Hi there! I'm Jessica. My interests include data analysis, IoT, and of course the latest smart devices.\" , \"start_char\": 5401.000000 , \"title\": \"iPhone Emoji Meanings: What emojis actually mean? And when to use them? - ESR Blog\" , \"url\": \"https://www.esrgear.com/blog/iphone-emoji-meanings/\" }"},"time":15},"model_calls":34,"document_judgments":26,"relevance_3":7,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
